(Phnom Penh): On the morning of May 26, 2021, the Ministry of National Defense vaccinated 19 Kovid vaccines to the athletes who are preparing to go to the SEA Games, as well as engineers, construction workers, Ministry of National Defense and construction workers. Moradok Techo Stadium, about 1,500 people, the second dose is already at Moradok Techo Stadium.
The second dose of Kovid 19 vaccination for the above group of people was attended by the leaders of the Ministry of National Defense, national sports leaders and some stakeholders.
Ms. Chea Lai Vann, who works for the Ministry of National Defense, confirmed to Fresh News: She is very excited to be vaccinated against Kovid 19 and now thanks to the Royal Government of Samdech Techo Hun Genes that have been carefully considered by providing vaccines to people of all walks of life for the well-being of all people.
Ms. Chea Layvann called on people not to be deceived by the propaganda of a small number of individuals after she was vaccinated against Kovid 19, there is no problem, but on the contrary, this vaccine protects against Kovid 19 while People in many countries have also been vaccinated in China.
Mr. Chantra, a volunteer who came to be vaccinated against 19 types of Kovidin syphilis, stated, “It is a good thing to get the Kovid 19 vaccine, as Cambodia is currently suffering from an epidemic. "Kovid 19, in particular, can protect our people from the dangers of this disease."
In addition, he also called on other people who have been vaccinated against Kovid 19 to hurry to register everyone to be part of the Royal Government of Cambodia to prevent the spread of Kovid 19 in Communities, in particular, must adhere strictly to the guidelines of the Ministry of Health and the "3 do's and don'ts 3" measures.
Ms. Kuch Hee, a compensation worker working around the Victory Monument, expressed her happiness "when she was vaccinated against Kovid 19 now. "After the injection, it feels normal, nothing has changed, but on the contrary, it is extremely happy."
According to the report of the Ministry of National Defense of Cambodia, released on May 25, 2021, the first 19 cases of Kovid vaccinated to 1,092,213 soldiers, their families and their citizens were vaccinated. The Red Zone has 786,020 people, while the second injection has 707,039 people. The first youth rehabilitation center in Cambodia is completed and planned to transfer illegal minors in June.
(Kandal): The first youth rehabilitation center in Cambodia, located in Bakou commune, Kandal Steung district, Kandal province, has been completed and is scheduled to transfer juveniles under the age of 18 from prison to its location in June 2021. This face.
Regarding the construction of the Youth Rehabilitation Center, Mr. Vong Soth, Minister of Social Affairs, accompanied by Mr. Kong Sophoan, Governor of Kandal Province, inspected the building and general organization of the center while the center was completed.
This Youth Rehabilitation Center is the first center in Cambodia to be established in accordance with the Juvenile Justice Act to transfer juveniles under the age of 18 from prison to receive separate skills training from juvenile offenders. From 18 years old.
According to the plan, the transfer of illegal minors to the location of this youth rehabilitation center can start in June. This was confirmed by Mr. Din Borey, Director of the Department of Youth Rehabilitation of the Ministry of Social Affairs.
He said that in the first phase, it is planned to put 100 to 200 people to test. The direct capacity of the whole center is to receive up to 2,000 illegal minors. He added that the transfer of minors to the center is limited in time, in case the juveniles violate the law, they will be sent back to prison.
Mr. Din Borey stated that for the transfer of illegal minors from the prison to the new center, there will be a lot of skills training in line with the current market demand, including skills such as repairing mobile phones and air conditioning. Originally to turn them into good resources capable of earning a living after the end of the sentence.
Currently, the Ministry of Social Affairs has been making three major achievements in the geography of Bakou commune, Kandal Steung district, Kandal province, including:
* First: the establishment of a care and rehabilitation center for the mentally ill, which has been open for some time * Second: the newly completed youth rehabilitation center * Third: the National Center for Drug Treatment and Rehabilitation Which is under construction.
Adviser to the Ministry of Cults handed over 2 water wells and food to 80 families in Sangkum Thmey District, Preah Vihear Province
(Preah Vihear): Mr. Khan Khon, Advisor of the Ministry of Cult and Religion and Director of the Good News Mission Association in collaboration with Bima Real Estate Company, handed over 2 water wells and provided food to 80 families in Preah Vihear Province on May 26, 2021.
The ceremony was attended by Mr. Ko Subunsoeut, Deputy Governor, Representative of Mr. Prak Sovann, Governor of Preah Vihear and district, commune, village and many people.
Mr. Khan Khon stated that Samdech Techo Hun Sen was the leader who took great care to save the lives and property of the people as well as went directly to the affected areas by distributing food donations. Food and supplies were delivered on time, leaving no one to starve.
At the same time, Mr. Khan Khon continued to urge all citizens to take good care of their health by living a clean life, eating clean, not defecating in the open, sleeping under a mosquito net to prevent malaria or dengue fever and respecting traffic laws. Together to protect personal safety and the safety of others, reduce deaths, disabilities and educate children to stay away from drugs because drugs destroy the future of families and society.
Mr. Khan Khon also urged the people and all participants to be very careful by participating in the implementation of 3 protections and 3 do not follow the recommendations of the head of the Royal Government, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister and the Ministry of Health.
Local authorities and residents thanked Mr. Khan Khon and Bima Real Estate for distributing the donations during this difficult time. It should be noted that 40 families in Tbeng Meanchey district and 40 families in Sangkum Thmey district, including 2 water wells, each family received rice, noodles, fish sauce, soy sauce.
General knowledge: Understand the history of coffee production and consumption
(Foreign): Coffee is a beverage made from the seeds of a tropical green plant that originated in Africa. Coffee is one of the three most popular beverages in the world, including tea and pure drinking water, and it is also one of the most lucrative international commodities.
Nowadays, there are many types of coffee, but this drink is especially popular because of the effect of its taste that makes us drink and feel full of energy and bright spirit. This effect is caused by caffeine, an alkaline substance found in coffee drinks.
Robusta coffee is cheaper and has twice as much caffeine as Arabica coffee, most of which are selected for cheaper brands. Brazil, West Africa and Central Africa, as well as Southeast Asia, are the leading producers of this coffee.
