China encourages people to adhere to the idea of "saving is a matter of honor, waste is a disgrace"
Speaking of China, the most populous country in the world, if we watch ancient Chinese stories or understand Chinese history, we will see that no matter how glorious the period, there was always famine. Occurs in some areas as well. Thus, since ancient times, China has a saying: "People store food as the most important source of livelihood."
Therefore, satisfying all the people is not only the most important policy of power of all generations of Chinese leaders since ancient times, but also the goal of the efforts of scientists. Agriculture for generations as well.
In addition to food, natural resources are also limited resources, meaning that they can not be consumed indefinitely. And our humanity will continue to suffer.
In short, we should all have a conscience to save to build a world with sustainable development in the sense of leaving a beautiful nature and rich natural resources for future generations.
