(Kratie): Virgin Island is an important part of the "Chroy Banteay Virgin Ecotourism Community", located in Chroy Banteay Commune, Prek Prosop District, Kratie Province, approximately 20 km from Kratie Provincial Town. The beautiful nature of the archipelago is linked to the rich potential of the Mekong River.
In the middle of the waters of the Virgin Islands, it looks like a tourist monument floating on the Ganges. White sand beaches and waterfalls are the perfect place to camp for the night. On the other hand, tourists can appreciate the beauty of the water when the sun sets and eat dinner prepared by the community.
When dawn came, the sound of birds chirping in the forest made the atmosphere on the virgin island even more special. In addition to exploring the natural beauty of the island, tourists can also visit the water and eat delicious food under the shade of the trees. In addition, tourists can also take a ferry to see the natural beauty of the archipelago before returning to the community.
Another great attraction is the dolphin watching along the Mekong River, both in the morning and in the evening. The emergence of this rare animal really provides the happiest feeling for every visitor.
On the other hand, tourists should visit, learn about daily activities and relax in the community lodges to taste food and agricultural products in the community.
Of course, the presence of tourists visiting the "Chroy Banteay Virgin Ecotourism Community" not only gives a happy feeling, but also provides a direct income to the community to encourage them. He also contributes to the protection of natural resources in the community to continue forever.
