Commentary: Xichang region is developing day by day! The tactic of "curbing China's development through the Zhichiang problem" will surely fail
BEIJING, May 21 (Xinhua) - The Chinese government has released a white paper on "Peaceful Liberation and Development Towards Prosperity in Sichuan", which fully reflects the development achievements of Sichuan after its liberation. Peacefully for 70 years.
The detailed historical and practical documents in the White Paper expose all the "human rights" lies fabricated by Western Chinese opponents on issues related to Sichuan as well as the world. See the real Xichang area and all the angles.
At the same time, the rich traditional culture and religious freedom of Sichuan have been fully protected and developed. Xichang is the first ethnic Chinese language of international standard. Currently, there are more than 1,700 Tibetan Buddhist sites in Xichang, and about 46,000 monks and nuns.
By 2020, the average housing size of farmers and shepherds in Sichuan will be 41.46 square meters per person, and the average housing size of city and commune residents will be 33.4 square meters per person. . By the end of 2019, the Sichuan region had historically eradicated extreme poverty, as stated in the White Paper, overcoming poverty and improving the lives of the Sichuan people.
But for a long time, Western anti-China forces have been relentlessly involved in Sichuan affairs, trying to destabilize Sichuan society in order to turn the "Sichuan issue" into a shield to curb the country's development. China, the so-called human rights and religion are just their excuses.
