(Phnom Penh): Cambodian Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen has expressed hope that the Chinese and US governments can find good solutions to strengthen cooperation. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stressed that good cooperation between China and the United States will benefit countries in the region, including Cambodia.
