(Oddar Meanchey): Major General Huot Sothy, Oddar Meanchey Provincial Police Commissioner, led the Criminal Police Force and the Chongkal District Police Inspectorate to arrest a suspect in connection with a case of rape and murder of a woman and then throw her body. Enter the pond.
After receiving the information, Major General Huot Sothy led the specialized force of criminal planning and the Chongkal District Police Inspectorate to investigate the background of the victim named Nguy Soni, 17 years old, living in the above commune, occupation: farmer.
According to the parents of the victim, on May 15, 2021, at 12:00, the victim girl rode her bicycle to pick the ripe fruit at the above point, but in the evening she could not see her child returning home. He also told the village chief and neighbors to help find until the body was found dead on May 17, 2021 at 17:40.
After forensic examination and investigation, the police identified the target and arrested the suspect, Oeum Sary (aka Srey), 23 years old, living in the same village.
After interrogation, the suspect confessed that he had raped and killed the victim and then dumped the body in a forest pond, while the victim's bicycle was dumped into a stream. Distance from the scene about 200 meters.
The suspect is currently being questioned by specialized forces and a case is being prepared to be sent to court for legal proceedings.
