(Phnom Penh): Mrs. Khuon Sodary, President of the Asian Cultural Council, on May 17, 2021, sent a message of condolences to the family of the body of Professor Om Yuk Vanna.
The condolence message states: "As the President and Representative of the Asian Cultural Council, I am deeply saddened to receive the sad news of the death of Professor Om Yuk Vanna on Monday. May 17, 2021 at the age of 66 due to illness.
Professor Om Yuk Vanna is a respected and admired Royal Ballet Professor, who has dedicated her physical and mental strength and wisdom, and has spent most of her life contributing to the preservation and transfer of Khmer classical art heritage to The next generation of Khmer descendants to know the value of the cultural heritage of Khmer ancestors.
