Construction of Damnak Chheu Krom Dam started in August 2017 and will be completed in June 2021, with one main dam, 90,848 km main canal and a total of 362 artistic structures. Location: Ministry of Water Resources and Meteorology, led by Lim Kean Hor, financed by the Asian Development Bank.
