Three Chinese nationals were arrested in Sihanoukville for carrying the same Chinese rifle.
(Preah Sihanouk): Police in Preah Sihanouk Province launched an operation to crack down on three Chinese nationals armed with a handgun who shot and shot the same Chinese national (but were not injured) at Group 7, Village 2. Sangkat 3, Sihanoukville caused a great surprise on the evening of May 14, 2021.
Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police Commissioner Major General Chuon Narin told Fresh News on May 15, 2021 that at the time of the crackdown, the ethnic group did not surrender to the authorities and even fired at the authorities. Many were also injured, but no one was injured in the blast.
The General Commissioner described that at 05:50 pm on May 14, 2021, people reported to the police that on Chamno Sete Street in Group 7, Village 2, Sangkat 3, Sihanoukville, there was a case of ethnicity. The Chinese used Chinese rifles and fired one shot, with the gunman wearing a short-sleeved T-shirt and short jeans.
Immediately after receiving this information, the criminal police planning team cooperated with the intervention force, especially the Sangkat 3 police force, to arrive at the scene, but the suspect escaped. The police continued to search carefully and patrol. According to the suspect, the villagers reported that when they reached the Ta Kwan slope on a small road in Village 2, Sangkat 3, Sihanoukville, they found the suspect who was a gunman.
Suddenly, the police shouted for the suspect to stop. Suddenly, the suspect pulled out a gun from his waist and fired two shots at the police, but fortunately was not hit by the police. Passing from house to house to escape, the police cooperated to arrest the suspects until 6:40 AM to catch the suspects who were hiding near people's houses.
Then, at 7 pm, Jinpei 3 Casino, located in Group 13, Village 4, Sangkat 4, Sihanoukville, called to report to the competent force that the victim who was robbed by the suspect on Sete Slope Road was an employee of Jinpei Casino. Pei 3 and Jin Pei 3 Casino Company arrested 2 suspects and handed them over to the police.
Exhibits seized included a K59 pistol with registration number 7777, a pistol with four rounds of ammunition and five cartridges. The three suspects are being interrogated at the Sihanoukville Provincial Police Office to be sent to court for sentencing. Battambang CPPCC Receives 15 Tons of Rice from Donors to Participate in 19 Camouflage Campaigns
