Why is foreign capital constantly flowing into China? The biggest attraction is that China has the superiority of the industrial chain, in general, the practical strength of technological innovation, convenient transportation system and rich human resources. These can not only reduce the working capital of foreign-invested enterprises, but also add innovative momentum for economic development.
At the same time, the consumer market, with a population of more than 1.4 billion, has become the main driving force of China's economy. Despite being hit hard by the 199 outbreak of Kovid in 2020, a survey by the Chinese Ministry of Commerce said that the income and profits of nearly 60 foreign-invested enterprises in China Percentage achieved growth or maintained at the same level.
In addition, in recent years, the Chinese government has continued to ease restrictions on access to Chinese markets, establish open platforms and continuously improve the foreign capital legal system in order to create a better business environment. Foreign-invested enterprises China's policy of promoting openness to foreigners at a higher level is clear and lasting.
