(Phnom Penh): Fresh News Media, which was launched on May 15, 2014, will be 7 years old on May 15, 2021 with overcoming obstacles, hard work and perseverance. In order to gain a foothold in the battle of memory, which is recognized, supported and trusted by readers.
2020 and 2021 will be a difficult year for all kinds of businesses, both in Cambodia and in the world, due to the global epidemic of Kovid 19. Despite the devastation of this crisis, in 2020, Fresh News will continue to stand strong in providing fast and rich information to all readers and colleagues with about 130 people. .
