It should be noted that the police report said that at 8 pm on May 9, 2021, the perpetrator had a serious dispute with his 38-year-old wife at their home in Khon Rang commune, Boribo district. At that time, the perpetrator used a pair of scissors to stab his wife several times in the chest, causing him serious injuries, then the perpetrator continued to abuse his 3-year-old child, causing his death.
The perpetrators then set fire to the mattress and clothes to start the fire. The perpetrator waited in the house until the fire started to spread, knowing that the twins were still alive and locked in the bedroom. When the fire engulfed the house, the perpetrator went outside and waited until his neighbors found him.
Some of the victims died of their injuries before the fire, and some died in the blaze. The bodies of the twins were found in a hug.
The perpetrator was detained by the police on the night of the incident and gave some explanations to the police describing the beginning of the fire. At that time, the expert team also started to autopsy the body and the whole scene. When the team described and asked for some scientific evidence to the perpetrators, they began to confess to the murder and the fire.
Please be informed that the husband who killed his wife and four children and set fire to his house happened on the night of May 9, 2021 in Khon Rang commune, Baribo district, Kampong Chhnang province. .
