Please read the notice below: The Ministry of Public Works rejects some websites that claim to be sub-branches of the Ministry that can expire all types of driver's licenses to renew them legally.
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Public Works and Transport (MPWT) has completely denied the posting on the websites that the Ministry of Public Works Online sub-branch has prepared all kinds of legal driver's licenses with the expiration of the Ministry's list. The law claims that a sub-branch of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport can provide public services to the people.
The Ministry of Public Works on May 11, 2021 said that the information published in the above websites is false information, confusing the public, affecting the honor and dignity of the leaders of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport as well as the Royal Government.
The Ministry also requested the competent authorities to take legal action against the above-mentioned criminals who produced vehicle identification cards, fake license plates and driver's licenses, and advertised the sale of license plates on social media on various websites, especially to take action against the perpetrators. Fraud and forgery of these public documents, which cause confusion to the public to bring to justice.
At the same time, the Ministry encouraged as well as called on the public and the people to refrain from using informal public services, which easily fall into the fraud of fraudsters, leading to financial loss and turn to the use of public service centers in At locations recognized by the Ministry of Public Works and Transport.
In addition, to prevent public confusion, especially to prevent the dissemination of false information by crooks and corrupt individuals who cause insecurity and social unrest, the Ministry of Public Works and Transport has requested ministries, authorities The competent authorities shall take the strictest measures to crack down and arrest the perpetrators who have committed the above acts and bring them to justice.
Currently, the Ministry is also promoting and improving the reform of public services to be more efficient, transparent, accurate, accountable and fast in accordance with the correct policies of the Royal Government under the wise leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister. Of Cambodia.
