More recently, these politicians, who have repeatedly argued that they should uphold international order, which is based on the rule of law, are actually violating international law and the basic code of international relations.
The principle of non-interference in the internal affairs of other countries is an important principle and fundamental principle of international relations of the "United Nations Charter" and also a guarantee or principle to protect the sovereignty and national independence of countries, as well as to protect equality and International justice as well.
In 1970, the United Nations adopted the "Declaration of the Principles of International Law", which clearly states that no country or group of countries has the right to directly or indirectly interfere in internal affairs. And the diplomacy of other countries, in any form or under any pretext.
But some US politicians have ignored the above-mentioned international law, interfering in China's internal affairs and supporting the crimes of anti-China rebels and causing repeated unrest in Hong Kong. These things make you see more clearly that they are holding the banner of "freedom" and "democracy", but the real purpose is to make Hong Kong chaotic and prevent China.
Not only in Hong Kong, some American politicians have also practiced interference around the world. More than 70 years have passed since the end of World War II, from military aggression to sanctions and repression to incitement to unrest to protect its global hegemony. Use American-style interference to the best of your ability.
So every time some American politicians claim to stand with the "Hong Kong people", the whole world knows that this is just a joke. The "Hong Kong people" they refer to are, in fact, anti-Chinese rebels and cause unrest in Hong Kong. Human rights and freedoms in Hong Kong are fully guaranteed by basic law.
A small number of American politicians attempting to adversely affect Hong Kong's justice system and law will fail. At present, Hong Kong has no place for the "black hand" of the United States and the West to continue the unrest. BREAKING: Kampong Cham Province Detects and Identifies 21 More Positive Kovid 19
