(Pursat): A suspect was detained by the police based on his wife's complaint for raping his own child eight times, seven times, and finally was handcuffed.
The 35-year-old suspect lives in the commune where the incident took place and is a farmer. The victim was a 13-year-old girl.
At 06:40 this morning, May 08, 2021, the Sna Ansa Administrative Police Station received a complaint from the victim's mother suing her husband for raping her child. Decided up to 8 times after their children told about the rape of the father to the mother to complain to the authorities to take legal action.
