As the level of use of new formulas has been continuously raised and online and on-site use activities have accelerated the integration, China's potential for consumption has been constantly stimulated. It also brings more sharing opportunities to the whole world.
New ideas in traditional Chinese sentences: "To use natural resources to some extent and sparingly"
How to balance development and environmental protection is a real challenge for many countries. Based on the traditional Chinese concept of ecological civilization on "the use of natural resources to some extent and sparingly", Chinese President Xi Jinping said that the concept of ecological civilization development that the blue water, green mountains are mountains of gold, mountains of silver. This development idea is divided into 3 stages:
In the first stage, "only mountains of gold, mountains of silver, no need for blue water, green mountains," that is, regardless of the capacity of the environment, only the collection of natural resources should be abandoned. The process of industrialization has created unprecedented wealth, but also created an inseparable ecological conflict.
The second phase is "Need for mountains of gold, mountains of silver, need mountains of green, clean water", which focuses on sustainable and coordinated development. You have all recognized that the environment is the foundation of survival and development.
