According to experts, the increase in cases around the world, especially in India, is due to a combination of negligence as well as weak government action and the new mutation virus, which is believed to be one of the main reasons. In the wake of an increase in cases of infection and death, the question arises as to whether the COVID-19 vaccine can prevent or be effective against the new mutation virus.
Which new mutation viruses are causing concern?
The presence of a new mutant virus has been causing concern that it could counteract or reduce the effectiveness of the vaccine and could re-infect those who have already been infected, while some vaccine manufacturers claim that the vaccine They effectively prevent new metabolic viruses.
