(Phnom Penh): Mrs. O Vandin, Secretary of State and spokesperson of the Ministry of Health, sent three big messages to the people as a rule to protect themselves from Kovid 19 after the closure of Phnom Penh and Takhmao. Kandal Province.
This message was sent after the Royal Government issued a decision to end the blockade of Phnom Penh and Takhmao City of Kandal Province, effective from May 6, 2021.
The three main messages that senior officials of the Ministry of Health send to the people are as follows: 1: Everyone must learn to live with Kovid 19 virus without infecting it. She advises that when going to work or to eat, how to prevent Kovid 19 by implementing 3 measures to prevent and 3 do not combine with vaccination, and if there is no need to stay home.
2. The sales location must follow the health rules. She advises site owners or site owners to be very careful when running their business, with safety in mind.
3: Social responsibility. "I urge you not to think that Kovid 19 is your story or your story. As a community member, you have to know where to look and where to get involved," he said. Apply health rules as well.
Previously, the Royal Government decided to block Phnom Penh and Takhmao for 3 weeks until May 5, 2021 due to the severe epidemic of Kovid 19, an unprecedented community event on February 20.
She continued: "Why did I say that? We now observe that most of the virus epidemics are transmitted in closed locations, and that location is crowded, closed, and where people do not communicate with each other. Properly implement the individual safety gap or social security gap.
Ms. O Vandin also stated that the closed areas, which include bars, karaoke or shops and markets, and factories, factories, now have a lot of problems where workers have a contagion, most of them live around Many in the same place, when there is an explosion, a Kovid will explode in clusters of several people.
The spokesperson of the Ministry of Health also continued to remind all people to strictly implement, stating that if the "3 protection" rule is implemented and do not forget to implement the "3 do not" rule at all, because this "3 protection 3 do" measures It is a very effective measure in the fight against Kovid 19, which in any country is implemented and effective.
