(Siem Reap): Siem Reap provincial authorities have expressed their concern over the recent crisis of the Kovid-19 epidemic in the community, especially the number of new cases being imported from other provinces. To prevent this problem, the provincial administration has set up a working group to monitor and monitor the return of people in the 12 communes of Siem Reap.
