He said that only the body of this woman was cremated. Later, if someone died of Kovid 19 and would be cremated at a new place located at the foot of a mountain in Rolea Bier district. Now, after protests and obstruction from the people not to bring the body of a woman with Kovid 19 to be cremated here, the provincial governor has decided to bury the body elsewhere.
