At 12 noon on May 2, they arrived in Kampong Chhnang province and were admitted to the provincial hospital without being rushed to their hometown. After diagnosing the disease, the provincial doctors decided to take a sample of So Heang for a quick test for Kovid 19, and as a result, she was positive for Kovid 19.
