In this regard, the USSR would like to draw your attention and appeal to the following national media friends and social media users:
* First, we have clearly seen that Kovid-19 has a profound effect on changing the way people live their lives and puts pressure on social norms everywhere in the world. Even "World Press Freedom Day" since last year and this year is not celebrated worldwide, and the way journalists work everywhere is changing dramatically.
