In order for the upcoming large-scale Kovid-19 vaccination campaign for the people living in the Red Zone to succeed as planned, General Ith Sarath, Deputy Commander-in-Chief and Joint Chief of Staff of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, on 29 April. In 2021, it requested the cooperation from the relevant ministries and institutions on three important points, including:
First, the Sangkat Council, each Khan Authority, should provide specific figures on the number of people living in their respective villages in each locality to make a vaccination plan.
Second, ask each district authority to call on people to get vaccinated at designated locations.
