Four members of a family in the northern province of Ha Nam and one in the southern part of Ho Chi Minh City were infected with the virus, all of whom had contact with an individual who had returned, the health ministry said. From Japan and tested positive despite being cataracted.
Authorities have ordered provincial governors and government agencies to step up surveillance and surveillance sources after an outbreak was reported in the community.
