Analysis: Turning the aspirations of Chinese people and countries around the world towards a better life to become a reality
"I hope to be able to vaccinate China for Q9 19 soon, and I would like to express my heartfelt thanks to China for helping us in this difficult time, we will always be grateful." A Cambodian tricycle rider said this with joy and excitement after hearing that the Chinese Kovid 19 vaccine had been delivered to Phnom Penh.
On February 7 this year, the Chinese Kovid 19 vaccine was delivered to Phnom Penh, bringing hope for a normal life and economic recovery to the people of Cambodia. Since the outbreak of Kovid 19, people in China and around the world have been helping each other and overcoming obstacles together.
To date, China has been preparing to provide vaccine assistance to 80 countries and three international organizations to jointly build a common destiny of humanity through practical implementation.
Countries live on the same earth together. Promoting peace and development is the common goal of the peoples of the nations, and building a community of common destiny for humanity is also a current of global development.
At the opening ceremony of the 2021 annual meeting of the Boao Forum for Asia, Chinese President Xi Jinping delivered a keynote speech entitled "Together to Overcome Fate of Obstacles and Build a Future Together" The video initiates Asian countries as well as countries around the world to join hands in the fight against Kovid 19 and increase global governance to move towards the goal of building a community of common destiny for all of humanity.
Mankind has one earth, and mankind has one common future. Whether overcoming the current crisis or building a better future together, all human beings must work together to overcome obstacles and unite for cooperation.
Humanity should adapt to the historical trend of peaceful development and win-win cooperation, work hand in hand to face global challenges, lead to the fire of multilateralism, illuminate the way forward of humanity to move towards the direction of community building Together with the destiny of humanity, we will work together to build a world of lasting peace, security in general, common prosperity, openness, environment and freshness.
