BREAKING: Tbong Khmum Provincial Administration issues official statement confirming the death of a woman in Tbong Khmum district due to Kovid 19 disease
(Tbong Khmum): The administration of Tbong Khmum province on April 28, 2021 issued an official press release confirming the death of a 46-year-old woman in Tbong Khmum district due to Kovid 19 disease.
Tbong Khmum Provincial Administration confirmed that Sok Kim Soeun, 46, a Cambodian woman who died of Kovid 19 disease, lived in Rokar Thom Village, Chiro I Commune, Tbong Khmum District, Tbong Khmum Province on April 27, 2021 at 21:00. : 18 minutes at Preah Norodom Sihanouk Referral Hospital, Tbong Khmum.
