* The story of Chinese youth who were at the forefront of the fight against infectious diseases in early 2020, the most difficult time in the fight against the epidemic of Kuwait 19 Chinese youth are the most important force in charge of fighting infectious diseases .
"Always ready to go to the front line" "My skills can be used, I volunteer to help the front line work" ... Knowing that Wuhan urgently needs medical staff to deal with the epidemic of Kovid. 19 All the branches of Peking University Hospital responded actively by sending 428 medical staff to Hubei Province, including 282 young people under the age of 35.
Some of them have just had children, some of them have postponed their wedding, Chinese New Year 2020, these young doctors went to save lives at the forefront of bravely preventing infectious diseases to be the Great Wall for Fighting infectious diseases.
The youngest member of the medical team was born in 1997. He struggled throughout the ICU and celebrated his birthday at the forefront of the fight against infectious diseases. Part of the medical work is treatment, the other part is caring for and encouraging the patient. Serious patients who are chronically ill are not allowed to be cared for, feeding, bowel movements and urination are the mainstays of medical care.
In addition to examining the symptoms of the most seriously ill patients, the medical team also added care, cleaning and food delivery. This is the respect and care from the heart of the medical team. The young Chinese Communist Party member in the medical team said, "This special journey is a precious asset of my life, and I will encourage you not to be afraid of difficulties and problems, to be brave and responsible!"
* Stories of Chinese youth who implement and directly promote poverty eradication
The villagers did not believe her, Wang Ming Ming also explained and advertised in each house, the dead strawberry tree was removed, new planting was added, no knowledge of planting techniques, no budget, invited experts to train Wang Ming Ming went to study directly Etc. Under Wang Mingming's leadership, more and more villagers changed their minds, and Sikhong Village established the next strawberry orchard, fruit orchard.
In addition, Wang Mingming has never forgotten the duties of party cadres in lifting people out of poverty and achieving a decent standard of living. Bring people out of poverty through industrial development.
Today, Sikong has become a model village for industry. Wang Ming Ming is considering increasing the income of the villagers. More and more young villagers want to return to work in their hometowns. She believes that rural development needs young people to provide employment opportunities for them to achieve their rural development dreams.
Xi Jinping advised Chinese youth to have a good life, to be grateful, to drink water and to miss their origins. The life goals of different young people are different, the career choices are also different, but if one can take into account the needs of the motherland, the common destiny with the people can also get a certain value of life.
