Chinese Embassy: Official approval for Cambodian mango export directly to China is another important achievement for Cambodia-China cooperation
(Phnom Penh): The Chinese Embassy in Cambodia on April 27, 2021, through its official Facebook page, marked the official approval to export Cambodian mangoes directly to China as another important achievement for cooperation. Apparently between China and Cambodia under the condition of Kovid 19.
The Chinese Embassy confirmed that on April 26, 2021, the Chinese Customs Administration officially announced the list of mango plantations and packaging factories registered in the export of Cambodian mangoes to China. This is the completion of the final procedure of both sides in the export of Cambodian mangoes to China. Thirty-seven plantations and five packaging factories are licensed for this export.
"Cambodian mangoes have become the second most exported fruit to China after bananas," the Chinese embassy said. "This is another important achievement for the practical cooperation between China and Cambodia under the status of Kovid-19 virus and will help promote mutually beneficial cooperation between the two countries in the field of agriculture."
The Chinese embassy also reminded that in June 2020, China and Cambodia signed a protocol on phytosanitary requirements for mango exports to China. On March 10, 2021, the Chinese side inspected the list of mango plantations and packaging plants for export to China, and on April 26, 2021, the Chinese side formally decided on the list of mango plantations and Packaging plant.
Mr. Veng Sakhon, Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, expressed his deep gratitude to the Chinese government, especially the General Administration of Customs, for officially allowing the export of fresh mangoes from Cambodia.
The Minister said that for the official celebration of the export of fresh mangoes from Cambodia directly to China, the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries will cooperate with the Chinese Ambassador to Cambodia to check the feasibility and possible time in the week. This.
