The Ministry of Health has confirmed that a 65-year-old Cambodian man living in Tbong Khmum district, Tbong Khmum province, suffered a serious head-on accident and was sent by his family to the Cambodia-China Friendship Hospital in Preah Kosomak on April 12, 2021. April 19, 2021.
