Measures to restrict or prohibit travel in and out of geographically affected areas of Kovid 19
Measures to block places, areas or geographies where there is a severe epidemic of Kovid 19
Measures to restrict or ban gatherings and gatherings of people whose activities may lead to the spread of Kovid 19, such as alcohol gatherings
Prohibitions or restrictions on work or occupation activities that pose a risk or source of the spread of Kovid 19, such as a ban on the sale of alcohol.
* Traffic ban measures
Measures to identify and locate those directly or indirectly associated with Kovid 19, sampling for Kovid 19 and strengthening of catalytic measures and treatment
* Strengthening health safety measures, especially "3 protection and 3 no" measures, etc.
