Hun Many and his wife provide milk powder to 57 families and infants in the Red Zone
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Hun Many, President of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia and his wife, Ms. Yim Chhay Lin, provided milk powder to 57 families and children living in the Red Zone in Sangkat Stung Meanchey 1, Stung Meanchey 2 and Stung Meanchey 3, Khan Meanchey.
The donation of milk powder was handed over by the team of Mr. Hun Many and Ms. Yim Chailin together with the authorities to the families of infants and children from 1 month to 3 years old this morning, April 24, 2021.
According to the team, the donation of milk powder came after the parents of all 57 infants and children called on social media for the lack of milk powder for their children.
After receiving this information, Mr. HUN Many and his wife also contacted and arranged the milk powder and instructed the team to provide it immediately.
The mothers of the infants and children who received the milk powder thanked Mr. Hun Many and Ms. Yim Chailin for their compassion for their children and giving them milk powder when they were in trouble.
